---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PopUp from '../components/PopUp.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Página Inicial"
    description="Bem-vindo ao Grupo Espírita Paulo de Tarso (GEPT) em Uberlândia, MG. Promovemos o estudo sistematizado da Doutrina Espírita, o tratamento espiritual, palestras e obras sociais."
>
    <PopUp />
    <!-- 1. Hero Section (Unified Carousel) -->
    <section class="relative pt-6 md:pt-12 pb-12 md:pb-16 px-4 bg-gray-50 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
            
            <!-- Unified Carousel -->
            <div class="w-full aspect-[4/5] sm:aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[21/9] bg-gray-100 md:rounded-[2.5rem] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative border border-gray-200 group" id="main-carousel">
                
                <!-- Slide 0: Cursos -->
                <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-100 flex items-end">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-left md:bg-center" style="background-image: url('/images/promo-cursos-banner.jpg');"></div>
                    
                    <div class="relative z-10 p-6 md:p-10 mb-6 mx-4 md:mb-12 md:mx-12 w-full max-w-2xl transform transition-transform duration-700 translate-y-0">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-3 md:mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">Conheça o Espiritismo</h2>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl text-gray-50 mb-6 md:mb-8 font-medium drop-shadow-md">Estude o Espiritismo através de cursos gratuitos e acessíveis para toda a família.</p>
                        <a href="/cursos-espiritismo" class="inline-block bg-white text-[#00334e] hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg">Inscreva-se Agora</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 1: Tratamento Espiritual -->
                <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0 flex items-end">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-right md:bg-center brightness-75" style="background-image: url('/images/promo-tratamento-banner.jpg');"></div>
                    
                    <div class="relative z-10 p-6 md:p-10 mb-6 mx-4 md:mb-12 md:mx-12 w-full max-w-2xl transform transition-transform duration-700 translate-y-0">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-3 md:mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">Tratamento Espiritual</h2>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl text-gray-50 mb-6 md:mb-8 font-medium drop-shadow-md">Conjunto de práticas com objetivo de promover o bem estar físico, mental e espiritual.</p>
                        <a href="/tratamento-espiritual" class="inline-block bg-white text-[#00334e] hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg">Ver Horários</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 2: Evangelização Infantil -->
                <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0 flex items-end">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-left md:bg-center brightness-75 saturate-50" style="background-image: url('/images/promo-evangelizacao-banner.jpg');"></div>
                    
                    <div class="relative z-10 p-6 md:p-10 mb-6 mx-4 md:mb-12 md:mx-12 w-full max-w-2xl transform transition-transform duration-700 translate-y-0">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-3 md:mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">Evangelização Infantil</h2>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl text-gray-50 mb-6 md:mb-8 font-medium drop-shadow-md">Amparando o desenvolvimento da criança sob a luz do Cristo para o mundo de amanhã.</p>
                        <a href="/evangelizacao-infantil" class="inline-block bg-white text-[#00334e] hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg">Saiba Mais</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Slide 3: Mocidade -->
                <div class="carousel-slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-1000 opacity-0 flex items-end">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center blur-[2px] scale-105" style="background-image: url('/images/activities/mocidade.jpeg');"></div>
                    
                    <div class="relative z-10 p-6 md:p-10 mb-6 mx-4 md:mb-12 md:mx-12 w-full max-w-2xl transform transition-transform duration-700 translate-y-0">
                        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-3 md:mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">Mocidade Espírita</h2>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl text-gray-50 mb-6 md:mb-8 font-medium drop-shadow-md">Núcleo voltado para jovens a partir de 12 anos. Confraternização, estudos doutrinários e ações no bem.</p>
                        <a href="/mocidade" class="inline-block bg-white text-[#00334e] hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg">Conheça</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Carousel Indicators -->
                <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 md:bottom-8 md:right-8 flex gap-3 z-20">
                    <button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 md:w-4 md:h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-opacity opacity-100 hover:scale-110 drop-shadow-md border border-gray-200" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
                    <button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 md:w-4 md:h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-opacity opacity-40 hover:opacity-70 hover:scale-110 drop-shadow-md border border-gray-200" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
                    <button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 md:w-4 md:h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-opacity opacity-40 hover:opacity-70 hover:scale-110 drop-shadow-md border border-gray-200" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
                    <button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 md:w-4 md:h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-opacity opacity-40 hover:opacity-70 hover:scale-110 drop-shadow-md border border-gray-200" aria-label="Slide 4"></button>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
            const dots = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-dot');
            if (slides.length === 0) return;
            
            let currentSlide = 0;
            let slideInterval;

            const goToSlide = (index) => {
                slides[currentSlide].classList.replace('opacity-100', 'opacity-0');
                if(dots[currentSlide]) dots[currentSlide].classList.replace('opacity-100', 'opacity-40');
                
                currentSlide = index;
                
                slides[currentSlide].classList.replace('opacity-0', 'opacity-100');
                if(dots[currentSlide]) dots[currentSlide].classList.replace('opacity-40', 'opacity-100');
            };

            const nextSlide = () => {
                goToSlide((currentSlide + 1) % slides.length);
            };

            slideInterval = setInterval(nextSlide, 5000);

            dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
                dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    clearInterval(slideInterval);
                    goToSlide(index);
                    slideInterval = setInterval(nextSlide, 7000);
                });
            });
        });
    </script>

    <!-- Programação Section -->
    <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-800">Programação Semanal</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-xl mx-auto text-lg">Conheça nosso cronograma semanal de atividades.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
                    <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Segunda-feira • 20h00</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800">Triagem Fraterna</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Atendimentos por ordem de chegada. Diálogo fraterno e esclarecimento individual sobre o programa da Casa.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
                    <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Terça-feira • 19h45</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800">Reunião Pública</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Palestras abertas e passes magnéticos (presencial e online).</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
                    <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Quarta-feira • 19h45</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800">Tratamento Espiritual</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Tratamento de desobsessão, evangelização e cura</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
                    <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Sábado • Manhã</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800">Evangelização e CECX</h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-2">
                        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-800">09h00:</span> Mocidade Espírita</li>
                        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-800">09h10:</span> Evangelização Infantil</li>
                        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-800">09h30:</span> Campanha de Esclarecimento Chico Xavier</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
                    <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Sábado • 17h15</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800">Cursos Espiritismo</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Global Kardec (Estudos Sistematizados).</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white border border-gray-100 p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-gray-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
                    <div class="text-brand-blue font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Domingo • Manhã</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-800">Mocidade e CFAS</h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm space-y-2">
                        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-800">09h00:</span> Campanha de Fraternidade Auta de Souza</li>
                        <li><span class="font-medium text-gray-800">09h30:</span> Mocidade Espírita</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Volunteer/Donate CTA Section -->
    <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-blue text-white relative overflow-hidden mt-12">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 32px 32px;"></div>
        
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">Apoie nossas atividades sociais</h2>
                <p class="text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">A manutenção da nossa casa e das obras sociais depende inteiramente da união e generosidade de nossos voluntários e doadores. Saiba como fazer a diferença.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
                <!-- Campanha Auta de Souza Card -->
                <div class="bg-white text-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 hover-card shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <img src="/images/C.F.A.S-Logo.png" alt="CFAS" class="h-16 mb-4">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Campanha de Fraternidade Auta de Souza</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">A Campanha de Fraternidade “Auta de Souza” destina-se a levar a sublimidade dos ensinos de Jesus, através da Doutrina Espírita, aos lares visitados, ao mesmo tempo que angaria recursos e donativos para famílias mais necessitadas</p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/campanha-auta-de-souza" class="inline-block text-center w-full py-3 bg-brand-blue text-white font-medium rounded-xl hover:bg-brand-blueDark transition">
                        Conheça o Projeto
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Financial Donation Card -->
                <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 hover-card shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-blue rounded-bl-full opacity-20"></div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Doação Financeira</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8 text-sm">Sua contribuição ajuda a manter nossas portas abertas e sustenta nossos projetos de assistência social.</p>
                        
                        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 mb-4">
                            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 font-semibold">Chave PIX (Celular)</div>
                            <div class="text-lg font-mono font-bold text-white select-all">3499879-4774</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-center">
                            Favorecido:<br>
                            <span class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Lar Fabiano de Cristo</span><br>
                            (Obras sociais do Grupo Espírita Paulo de Tarso)
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
